  "description": "Add `CookbookApp/ShoppingLists/AddItemSheet.swift` \u2014 a `.sheet` wrapping a `NavigationStack` (title \"Add item\"). Contains a `Form` with two rows: a `TextField` (item text, placeholder \"e.g., 2 lemons, 500g flour\") and a `.menu`-style `Picker` for aisle (options from `AisleCatalog.aisles` + a final \"Other\" option whose value is nil; default selection is \"Other\"). Toolbar: \"Cancel\" (leading, dismisses) and \"Add\" (trailing, disabled until item text non-empty after trimming). On Add: non-nil aisle calls `appendItem(_:toAisle:)`, nil calls `appendItem(_:)`, then dismisses. When `AisleCatalog.isLoaded == false`, the \"Add\" button is disabled and the Picker shows a \"Loading aisles\u2026\" placeholder row.",
